# frontend-master skill

When editing `.tsx` under `frontend/src/` for a **form, data-fetching component, new page/screen, accessibility-sensitive interaction, or frontend dependency** — **read and apply** `.cursor/skills/frontend-master/SKILL.md` before writing code.

**Skip** for trivial label/copy-only edits, prop renames, or test-only changes.

Mandatory outcomes from the skill: four UI states, next-intl keys (no hardcoded English), shadcn + Tailwind tokens, Vitest+RTL tests, Playwright `@smoke` for new pages, generated API types (never hand-mirrored).
